---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions - A.I.T Engineers" description="Terms and Conditions of Business and Service for A.I.T Engineers">
  <!-- Page Hero Banner -->
  <section class="hero hero--page" id="top">
    <div class="hero__media">
      <img class="hero__img" data-parallax="0.14"
           src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1496247749665-49cf5b1022e9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2200&q=70"
           alt="" aria-hidden="true" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
    <div class="hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero__grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero__sheen" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- CAD line graphics -->
    <svg class="hero__cad" viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
      <g class="cad-lines">
        <path class="draw" d="M-40 700 L420 700 L640 300 L1100 300 L1480 300"/>
        <path class="draw" d="M1480 780 L1080 780 L900 460 L520 460"/>
        <path class="draw" d="M180 900 L180 640 L340 380 L340 -20"/>
        <path class="draw" d="M1240 -20 L1240 220 L1360 430 L1360 900"/>
      </g>
    </svg>

    <div class="hero__inner shell hero__inner--page" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center;">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light hero__eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow__mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#apex"/></svg></span>
        Commercial & Engineering Terms
      </p>

      <h1 class="hero__title hero__title--page">
        <span class="line">Terms & Conditions</span>
      </h1>

      <nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/">Home / Terms & Conditions</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section class="band band--white legal-content" style="padding: 80px 0;">
    <div class="shell" style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="legal-card">
        <p class="legal-meta"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Last Updated:</strong> March 2026</p>

        <p class="legal-intro">
          Welcome to the official website of <strong>A.I.T Engineers</strong>. By accessing or using this website, requesting quotations, or engaging us for the engineering, fabrication, supply, and delivery of industrial equipment, you agree to be bound by the terms and conditions outlined below.
        </p>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>1. General Scope of Services</h2>
          <p>
            A.I.T Engineers specializes in engineering, fabrication, and manufacturing of industrial equipment—including storage tanks, bulk silos, heat exchangers, heating coils, buoyancy equipment, and custom structural packages. All equipment is manufactured against mutual technical drawings, formal purchase orders, and agreed project specifications.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>2. Quotations, Inquiries & Purchase Orders</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Information, product photographs, and general specifications provided on this website serve informational purposes and do not constitute an irrevocable commercial binding offer.</li>
            <li>Formal quotations issued by A.I.T Engineers remain valid for the period specified within the quotation document, subject to material price fluctuations and availability at the time of order confirmation.</li>
            <li>Work commences strictly upon receipt of an authorized Purchase Order (PO), agreed advance payment terms, and signed approval of technical fabrication drawings.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>3. Design Approvals & Manufacturing Specifications</h2>
          <p>
            Fabrication is conducted based on mutually agreed General Arrangement (GA) drawings and technical specifications. Any revisions or scope additions requested after drawing approval or cutting of steel may result in adjusted timelines, material variation charges, and amended commercial terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>4. Quality Assurance & Inspection</h2>
          <p>
            Quality checks are carried out during defined stages of manufacturing (raw material verification, dimensional layout, weld inspections, and pressure/leak tests where applicable). Clients or third-party inspection agencies (TPIA) are welcome for stage-wise or pre-dispatch inspection as stipulated in the agreed contract.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>5. Delivery, Dispatch & Site Handover</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Delivery schedules quoted are based on standard production timelines and prevailing supply chain conditions at the time of order confirmation.</li>
            <li>Unless explicitly specified otherwise, dispatch terms are Ex-Works / FOB our facility. Transit insurance, unloading, site readiness, foundation preparation, and civil supports remain the responsibility of the client.</li>
            <li>A.I.T Engineers shall not be held liable for delivery delays arising from Force Majeure events, strikes, transport disruptions, power outages, or site access restrictions outside our reasonable control.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>6. Intellectual Property & Drawings</h2>
          <p>
            All website content, engineering diagrams, logos, photographs, CAD concepts, and descriptive literature are the proprietary intellectual property of A.I.T Engineers. Unauthorized reproduction, publication, or redistribution without prior written consent is strictly prohibited.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, A.I.T Engineers shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages, including loss of production, revenue, or business interruption, resulting from equipment operation beyond rated technical parameters or improper maintenance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>8. Governing Law & Jurisdiction</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms and Conditions and any commercial contracts entered into with A.I.T Engineers shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes arising shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts in <strong>Thane / Mumbai, Maharashtra</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section legal-contact-box">
          <h2>9. Questions & Clarifications</h2>
          <p>For any queries regarding commercial terms, fabrication agreements, or vendor guidelines, please reach out to our team:</p>
          <div class="contact-card">
            <p><strong>A.I.T Engineers</strong></p>
            <p>Thane, Maharashtra, India</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@aitengineers.com">info@aitengineers.com</a></p>
            <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+919876543210">+91 98765 43210</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 48px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    color: var(--c-text, #1f2937);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c-pri, #006A9A);
  }

  .legal-section p {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-contact-box {
    margin-top: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding-top: 32px;
  }

  .contact-card {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--c-pri, #006A9A);
  }

  .contact-card p {
    margin: 4px 0;
    color: #1e293b;
  }

  .contact-card a {
    color: var(--c-pri, #006A9A);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contact-card a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-card {
      padding: 28px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
